# 13. Supervised and Unsupervised Learning

## Supervised Learning

The training data contains labels.

```text
Input → Label

Image → Dog
Image → Dog
Image → Cat
Image → Cat
```

The model learns to predict the label.

---

## Unsupervised Learning

The data does not contain explicit labels.

```text
Image
Image
Image
Image
Image
```

The model attempts to discover patterns or groups within the data.

Conceptually:

```text
Similar Data
     ↓
Group 1

Similar Data
     ↓
Group 2
```

