# 14. What is a Model?

A model can be thought of as a function:

```text
Input
  ↓
MODEL
  ↓
Output
```

For example:

```text
Image
  ↓
Image Classification Model
  ↓
Dog
```

Or:

```text
Text
  ↓
Language Model
  ↓
Generated Text
```

Internally, models contain **parameters**.

During training, these parameters are adjusted so that the model produces better outputs.

