# 29. GPT

GPT stands for:

```text
G = Generative
P = Pre-trained
T = Transformer
```

### Generative

The model generates content.

### Pre-trained

The model is trained beforehand on large amounts of data.

### Transformer

The underlying architecture is based on the Transformer architecture.

Therefore:

```text
GPT
=
Generative
+
Pre-trained
+
Transformer
```

