# 30. Why LLMs Need Context

Return to the e-commerce chatbot.

Suppose the customer asks:

```text
"Can I return my order after 15 days?"
```

A general LLM might generate:

```text
"Yes, you can return your order within 30 days."
```

But suppose the actual company policy is:

```text
Returns are allowed only within 7 days.
```

The LLM may not automatically know the company's private internal policy.

Therefore, the application needs to provide relevant context.

For example:

```text
User Query
    +
Company Return Policy
    +
Order Information
    +
Previous Conversation
    ↓
LLM
    ↓
Context-Aware Response
```

This is an important foundation for techniques such as providing external information/context to LLMs.

